    "body": "COM-API uses pastey as a replacement for paste for compile-time identifier concatenation in its interface macros.\n\nThe Pastey safety-related supporting artifacts are available in score-crates issue [#42](https://github.com/eclipse-score/score-crates/issues/42), including requirements, design, safety analysis, component classification, traceability, and coverage information. These artifacts support a distributor or integrator\u2019s qualification activities; they do not themselves constitute qualification or certification of Pastey.\n\nThe Pastey usage and supporting artifacts are documented.",
